{"parse":{"title":"Nightmare Orioles","pageid":433652,"revid":2127149,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><i><div role=\"note\" class=\"notice hatnote context-link about dablink\">This article is about <a href=\"/wiki/Illuga\" title=\"Illuga\">Illuga</a>'s Constellation.&#32;For the <a href=\"/wiki/Lightkeeper\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightkeeper\">Lightkeeper</a> squad led by Illuga, see <a href=\"/wiki/Lightkeepers#&quot;Nightmare_Orioles&quot;\" title=\"Lightkeepers\">Nightmare Orioles</a>.</div></i>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Nightmare Orioles</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Constellation_Nightmare_Orioles.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205151709\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Nightmare Orioles\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Constellation_Nightmare_Orioles.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205151709\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Constellation_Nightmare_Orioles.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205151709 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Constellation_Nightmare_Orioles.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205151709 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Nightmare Orioles\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Nightmare_Orioles.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Nightmare Orioles.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illuga\" title=\"Illuga\">Illuga</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hurricane_Steed\" title=\"Hurricane Steed\">Hurricane Steed</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Enhances the Lightkeeper's Oath effect of the Ascension Talent <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Torchforger's Covenant</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Torchforger's Covenant</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After unleashing Elemental Skill <a href=\"/wiki/Dawnbearing_Songbird\" title=\"Dawnbearing Songbird\">Dawnbearing Songbird</a> or Elemental Burst <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowless_Reflection\" title=\"Shadowless Reflection\">Shadowless Reflection</a>, other nearby party members will gain the Lightkeeper's Oath effect for 20s: For <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> dealt to opponents, CRIT Rate increases by 5% and CRIT DMG increases by 10%.<br /><br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b><br />Party members affected by the Lightkeeper's Oath effect have their Elemental Mastery increased by 50.</span></span></span>: For <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> dealt to opponents, CRIT Rate is increased by 10%, CRIT DMG is increased by 30%.<br /><br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b><br />When characters are affected by Lightkeeper's Oath, Elemental Mastery is increased by 80.<br />You must first unlock the Ascension Talent \"Torchforger's Covenant.\"</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_Rate\" title=\"CRIT Rate\">CRIT Rate</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_DMG\" title=\"CRIT DMG\">CRIT DMG</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Nightmare Orioles</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Illuga\" title=\"Illuga\">Illuga</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_6_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 6 Constellation\">Level 6 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNightmare_Orioles%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Nightmare Orioles</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">魇夜之莺</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Yǎnyè zhī Yīng</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Nightmare Night Orioles</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">魘夜之鶯</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Yǎnyè zhī Yīng</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">闇夜の鶯</span><br /><small><i>An'ya no Uguisu</i></small></td><td>Darknight <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_bush_warbler\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Japanese bush warbler\">Nightingale</a></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td>